id=mitm-cacert
name=MITM CA as system cert (Android 14/15 APEX)
version=@VERSION@
versionCode=@VERSIONCODE@
author=legend
description=Adds CA certs from /data/adb/mitmca/certs.d to the Conscrypt APEX trust store (/apex/com.android.conscrypt/cacerts) in init, zygote and running app mount namespaces. LAB USE ONLY.
